      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.24-p003",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "উপরের চিত্রে বর্ণিত এক-এক মিল থেকে দেখা যায় যে, $A \\cup B \\sim J_{p+q}$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A \\cup B \\sim J_{p+q}"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 19,
      "pdfPageEnd": 19,
      "printedPageStart": 14,
      "printedPageEnd": 14,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.24-p004",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "অর্থাৎ, $n(A \\cup B) = p + q = n(A) + n(B)$। এ থেকে নিচের প্রতিজ্ঞাটি বলা যায়।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "n(A \\cup B) = p + q = n(A) + n(B)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 19,
      "pdfPageEnd": 19,
      "printedPageStart": 14,
      "printedPageEnd": 14,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.24-p005",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**প্রতিজ্ঞা ৮.** যদি $A$ ও $B$ পরস্পর নিশ্চেষ্ট সান্ত সেট হয়, তবে $n(A \\cup B) = n(A) + n(B)$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A",
        "B",
        "n(A \\cup B) = n(A) + n(B)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 19,
      "pdfPageEnd": 19,
      "printedPageStart": 14,
      "printedPageEnd": 14,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.24-p006",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "এই প্রতিজ্ঞাকে সমপ্রসারণ করে বলা যায় যে, $n(A \\cup B \\cup C) = n(A) + n(B) + n(C)$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "n(A \\cup B \\cup C) = n(A) + n(B) + n(C)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 19,
      "pdfPageEnd": 19,
      "printedPageStart": 14,
      "printedPageEnd": 14,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.24-p007",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "একইভাবে $n(A \\cup B \\cup C \\cup D) = n(A) + n(B) + n(C) + n(D)$ ইত্যাদি,",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "n(A \\cup B \\cup C \\cup D) = n(A) + n(B) + n(C) + n(D)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 19,
      "pdfPageEnd": 19,
      "printedPageStart": 14,
      "printedPageEnd": 14,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.24-p008",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "যেখানে $A, B, C, D$ সেটগুলো পরস্পর নিশ্চেষ্ট সান্ত সেট।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A, B, C, D"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 19,
      "pdfPageEnd": 19,
      "printedPageStart": 14,
      "printedPageEnd": 14,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.24-p009",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**প্রতিজ্ঞা ৯.** যেকোনো সান্ত সেট $A$ ও $B$ এর জন্য $n(A \\cup B) = n(A) + n(B) - n(A \\cap B)$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A",
        "B",
        "n(A \\cup B) = n(A) + n(B) - n(A \\cap B)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 19,
      "pdfPageEnd": 19,
      "printedPageStart": 14,
      "printedPageEnd": 14,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.24-p010",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**প্রমাণ:** এখানে, $A \\setminus B$, $A \\cap B$ এবং $B \\setminus A$ সেট তিনটি পরস্পর নিশ্চেষ্ট সেট [ভেনচিত্র দ্রষ্টব্য]।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "A \\setminus B",
        "A \\cap B",
        "B \\setminus A"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 19,
      "pdfPageEnd": 19,
      "printedPageStart": 14,
      "printedPageEnd": 14,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
